      "update_usage_instructions": "How to use ROSBOT update feature:\n\n1. Download update package:\n   - Download ROSBOT update package (zip file) to Downloads directory\n   - Filename must contain region identifier: Asia (contains \"asia\" or \"Asia\") or CN (contains \"cn\" or \"CN\")\n   - File size must be between 20–50MB\n\n2. Version format:\n   - Filename must contain version number, format like: 36.0129 or 36_0129\n   - Version number will be automatically recognized and compared\n\n3. Update process:\n   - Click \"Update ROSBOT\" button\n   - System will automatically detect update packages in Downloads directory\n   - If a new version is found, a confirmation dialog will pop up\n   - After confirmation, it will extract to GameTools directory and update configuration\n\n4. Directory structure:\n   - After update, directory will be created: GameTools\\{Region}_{Version}\\RosBot\\\n   - Example: GameTools\\Asia_36.0129\\RosBot\\\n\n5. Configuration file:\n   - Old RoS-BoT.ini configuration file will be automatically copied during update\n   - ROSBOT path will be automatically updated to new version directory\n\n6. Notes:\n   - Currently running ROSBOT will be automatically stopped before update\n   - After update completes, you can choose whether to automatically start ROSBOT\n   - If region is not detected, both Asia and CN update packages will be checked",
